     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"{\\text{1: 15}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>If the odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"A:B\"></span>, then</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}} = \\frac{1}{{15 + 1}} = \\frac{1}{{16}}\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"P(E) = \\frac{1}{{16}}\">P(E) = \\frac{1}{{16}}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
