    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"2.5{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}1\"></span>.</p>\n<p>If the odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"A:B\"></span>, then</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}} = \\frac{{2.5}}{{2.5 + 1}} = \\frac{{2.5}}{{3.5}} = \\frac{{25}}{{35}} = \\frac{5}{7} \\approx 0.714\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
